# Quote Generator with History

## Description
A Flask-based application that fetches random quotes from an external API and stores quote history in SQLite database.

## Features
- Random Quote Generator
- API Integration
- Quote History Storage
- SQLite Database
- Flask Backend

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Flask
- SQLite
- Requests API
- HTML/CSS

## Installation

Install dependencies:

pip install -r requirements.txt

Run project:

python app.py
